{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows经PowerShell添加ActiveSync允许设备。对应需求：持久化。官方：New ActiveSyncAllowedDeviceID Added via PowerShell。","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"from":"now-9m","index":["endgame-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process-*","logs-m365_defender.event-*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*","logs-system.security*","logs-windows.forwarded*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","winlogbeat-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows经PowerShell添加ActiveSync允许设备","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows经PowerShell添加ActiveSync允许设备\n\n### 为何重要\n在重启或登录后保持立足点\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","references":["https://www.volexity.com/blog/2020/12/14/dark-halo-leverages-solarwinds-compromise-to-breach-organizations/","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/powershell/module/exchange/set-casmailbox?view=exchange-ps"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"ce64d965-6cb0-466d-b74f-8d2c76f47f05","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 持久化","来源: 默认","对应需求: 持久化"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.type == \"start\" and\n  process.name: (\"powershell.exe\", \"pwsh.exe\", \"powershell_ise.exe\") and process.args : \"Set-CASMailbox*ActiveSyncAllowedDeviceIDs*\"\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1098","name":"Account Manipulation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1098/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1098.002","name":"Additional Email Delegate Permissions","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1098/002/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0003","name":"Persistence","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0003/"}},{"framework":"MIT